(1472609, 192870, 7570, '<td valign="top">i like the yellow cast you chose for this shot, and the angle where this was shot. the blur and softness at the far end of the bridge gives this picture a mysterious feel, where we guess as to where to bridge leads to. overall a very pleasing photo. this is the first photo i rated for this metal challenge and i cant believe i''m leaving a comment already. if all submissions are gonna be this good, i''m gonna have a hard time choosing my favourite, lol.I''m giving you a 9. would have been a 10 if the motorist and their heads didnt distract me so much.</td>', 'i like the yellow cast you chose for this shot, and the angle where this was shot. the blur and softness at the far end of the bridge gives this picture a mysterious feel, where we guess as to where to bridge leads to. overall a very pleasing photo. this is the first photo i rated for this metal challenge and i cant believe i''m leaving a comment already. if all submissions are gonna be this good, i''m gonna have a hard time choosing my favourite, lol.I''m giving you a 9. would have been a 10 if the motorist and their heads didnt distract me so much.', '2005-06-22 01:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
