(1473665, 194072, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice effect...8</td>', 'Nice effect...8', '2005-06-22 07:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473671, 191488, 34547, '<td valign="top">Looks a little too grey. Play around with curves a little more.</td>', 'Looks a little too grey. Play around with curves a little more.', '2005-06-22 07:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473675, 192210, 34547, '<td valign="top">The slogan and all...hmm, who do you work for?</td>', 'The slogan and all...hmm, who do you work for?', '2005-06-22 07:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473681, 193065, 34547, '<td valign="top">It feels tilted to the right a bit. I love two parts; the simultaneous view of the subterranean and surface world with the two different color themes for each. But now I am just verbalizing what we can all see. Nice job.</td>', 'It feels tilted to the right a bit. I love two parts; the simultaneous view of the subterranean and surface world with the two different color themes for each. But now I am just verbalizing what we can all see. Nice job.', '2005-06-22 07:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473683, 192939, 35044, '<td valign="top">Is this the work of a sound engineer?<br/> <br/>Very nice tones and texture -  contrast in the grille is handled very well.  High contrast works well in b&amp;w.  Contrast between edge of frame and image looks fractionally soft on my screen - could be result of high contrast on lcd, rather than the image.   I like this a lot.</td>', 'Is this the work of a sound engineer? Very nice tones and texture -  contrast in the grille is handled very well.  High contrast works well in b&w.  Contrast between edge of frame and image looks fractionally soft on my screen - could be result of high contrast on lcd, rather than the image.   I like this a lot.', '2005-06-22 07:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473686, 192675, 34547, '<td valign="top">I find symmetry very attractive. Nice job taking the time to line everything up. This would be less interesting if the top ball was in the center of the frame. I might ask for a little more contrast.</td>', 'I find symmetry very attractive. Nice job taking the time to line everything up. This would be less interesting if the top ball was in the center of the frame. I might ask for a little more contrast.', '2005-06-22 07:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473690, 192587, 34547, '<td valign="top">Oh I get it...  :)</td>', 'Oh I get it...  :)', '2005-06-22 07:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473692, 193993, 31036, '<td valign="top">the photo is great, the border fits well. 8</td>', 'the photo is great, the border fits well. 8', '2005-06-22 07:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1473694, 192870, 34547, '<td valign="top">Interesting. How did you get this angle? Looks like the bridge floats off into nothing. I don''t agree so much with the hue.</td>', 'Interesting. How did you get this angle? Looks like the bridge floats off into nothing. I don''t agree so much with the hue.', '2005-06-22 07:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
