(1474115, 192991, 35804, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea I just wish the end of the barrel wasn''t chopped off...the crop is a bit too tight.</td>', 'Interesting idea I just wish the end of the barrel wasn''t chopped off...the crop is a bit too tight.', '2005-06-22 09:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1474119, 191422, 39430, '<td valign="top">Even as a woodworker, this photo doesn''t say anything to me.  I can''t put my finger on what''s missing.  Photographically, it could do with more interesting lighting (more focused light), or even just a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Even as a woodworker, this photo doesn''t say anything to me.  I can''t put my finger on what''s missing.  Photographically, it could do with more interesting lighting (more focused light), or even just a bit more contrast.', '2005-06-22 09:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
