(1474126, 192591, 39430, '<td valign="top">This looks like many images from my digicam - white balance looks off, and a very grainy noisy image.  Interesting subject, but maybe think about a more interesting framing/crop.</td>', 'This looks like many images from my digicam - white balance looks off, and a very grainy noisy image.  Interesting subject, but maybe think about a more interesting framing/crop.', '2005-06-22 10:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
