(1474133, 193175, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like this...the metal and reflection look great...my only grip is why not use the maximum 640 pixel dimension...the image seems a bit small...otherwise super cool!</td>', 'I really like this...the metal and reflection look great...my only grip is why not use the maximum 640 pixel dimension...the image seems a bit small...otherwise super cool!', '2005-06-22 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
