(1474515, 193169, 35602, '<td valign="top">Tried to do one similar, but because I couldn''t get it focused enough I decided to do something else.  I like the way you caught the metal relection.</td>', 'Tried to do one similar, but because I couldn''t get it focused enough I decided to do something else.  I like the way you caught the metal relection.', '2005-06-22 11:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
