(1474679, 192868, 39075, '<td valign="top">Nice use of texture.  I like how the wood, rusted barbs, and cable all have thier own color and textures.</td>', 'Nice use of texture.  I like how the wood, rusted barbs, and cable all have thier own color and textures.', '2005-06-22 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
