(1474807, 193935, 19025, '<td valign="top">I am rating this an 8 cuz it reminds me so much of mine. And I thought mine was really great.  I really like this kind of photograph where you wonder "what is it?"</td>', 'I am rating this an 8 cuz it reminds me so much of mine. And I thought mine was really great.  I really like this kind of photograph where you wonder "what is it?"', '2005-06-22 12:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
