(1475065, 191321, 39339, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this photographed from a different angle, although sometimes when photographing boats in the water, you can''t just move around it to get the shot you want!  Maybe come creative cropping?  I love the contrast of the very blue water and the red stack on the boat.</td>', 'Would love to see this photographed from a different angle, although sometimes when photographing boats in the water, you can''t just move around it to get the shot you want!  Maybe come creative cropping?  I love the contrast of the very blue water and the red stack on the boat.', '2005-06-22 13:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1475066, 190557, 10432, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  I think if you had repositioned yourself to get the cross against a simpler sky background this would be improved.  As it is - the cross blends into the building.  The lighting is a bit harsh (try more contrast and saturation) and maybe try cropping the blurred black foreground cross bar (or whatever that is).  BOL</td>', 'Not a bad idea.  I think if you had repositioned yourself to get the cross against a simpler sky background this would be improved.  As it is - the cross blends into the building.  The lighting is a bit harsh (try more contrast and saturation) and maybe try cropping the blurred black foreground cross bar (or whatever that is).  BOL', '2005-06-22 13:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1475067, 191142, 22517, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but the image is confusing, probably because it was rotated?</td>', 'I like the subject, but the image is confusing, probably because it was rotated?', '2005-06-22 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
