(1475111, 191465, 10432, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  I like the reflective nature of the metal here.<br/>I think this would be an excellent shot for B&amp;W and added contrast.  The crop is a bit much on the bottom escalator.  You might want to try to include a wider span of the second set of "steps".<br/>Also, your photo is a a bit small overall - using the full amount allowed by DPC would increase the drama.</td>', 'Great subject.  I like the reflective nature of the metal here.I think this would be an excellent shot for B&W and added contrast.  The crop is a bit much on the bottom escalator.  You might want to try to include a wider span of the second set of "steps".Also, your photo is a a bit small overall - using the full amount allowed by DPC would increase the drama.', '2005-06-22 13:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
