(1475784, 191132, 37875, '<td valign="top">Those heat lamps are the best!  I like the angle of the shot, and the warmth implied through the colors in the reflector.  GE should thank you for such a nice shot of their equipment!</td>', 'Those heat lamps are the best!  I like the angle of the shot, and the warmth implied through the colors in the reflector.  GE should thank you for such a nice shot of their equipment!', '2005-06-22 17:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
