(1476034, 194076, 37719, '<td valign="top">I don''t get flames from it, but I like it.  Very clever and unique in the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'I don''t get flames from it, but I like it.  Very clever and unique in the challenge.  Well done!', '2005-06-22 18:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
