(1476062, 193173, 37875, '<td valign="top">very impressionistic!  cool photo!  hard to tell that it''s metal with all the color and no edges to the object, though...in terms of the theme, i mean.</td>', 'very impressionistic!  cool photo!  hard to tell that it''s metal with all the color and no edges to the object, though...in terms of the theme, i mean.', '2005-06-22 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
