(1476080, 193066, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really am a sucker for good use of shallow DOF and what with the curves and diagonals this one works for me. Lacks a focal point of some kind to really give it more punch but still like it a lot.</td>', 'I really am a sucker for good use of shallow DOF and what with the curves and diagonals this one works for me. Lacks a focal point of some kind to really give it more punch but still like it a lot.', '2005-06-22 18:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476083, 192054, 37719, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective for sure.  In another challenge I may have liked this better.  But with all the possibilities, to me it is just like a shot of someone elses art.</td>', 'Interesting perspective for sure.  In another challenge I may have liked this better.  But with all the possibilities, to me it is just like a shot of someone elses art.', '2005-06-22 18:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
