(1476104, 190649, 37719, '<td valign="top">I have made 4 passes on this photo so far and it has finally started to grow on me.  I like the composition, lighting, shadow.  What I don''t like is the dark area at the bottom - camera shadow or intentional?  Nice job.</td>', 'I have made 4 passes on this photo so far and it has finally started to grow on me.  I like the composition, lighting, shadow.  What I don''t like is the dark area at the bottom - camera shadow or intentional?  Nice job.', '2005-06-22 18:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
