(1476169, 192316, 37875, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle for the machinery, but I think the person in the background detracts.  Would have liked to see a tighter shot just of the metal...would be interesting to see how it was in b&amp;w...</td>', 'Interesting angle for the machinery, but I think the person in the background detracts.  Would have liked to see a tighter shot just of the metal...would be interesting to see how it was in b&w...', '2005-06-22 18:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476170, 192037, 29601, '<td valign="top">crazy depth of focus.  really draws the eye to the barb</td>', 'crazy depth of focus.  really draws the eye to the barb', '2005-06-22 18:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476172, 192915, 37875, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, but can''t tell what the weapon is...so that detracts for me.</td>', 'Interesting picture, but can''t tell what the weapon is...so that detracts for me.', '2005-06-22 18:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476173, 193032, 9478, '<td valign="top">I think this does not fit the challenge very much. Metal is not the primary subject.</td>', 'I think this does not fit the challenge very much. Metal is not the primary subject.', '2005-06-22 18:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476175, 194016, 39653, '<td valign="top">Angle and lighting ''off''. I doubt photo does subject justice.</td>', 'Angle and lighting ''off''. I doubt photo does subject justice.', '2005-06-22 18:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476176, 192567, 37875, '<td valign="top">Like the needle with the foot!  That, with the thread, gives the picture a nice composition.</td>', 'Like the needle with the foot!  That, with the thread, gives the picture a nice composition.', '2005-06-22 18:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476178, 192437, 39653, '<td valign="top">Plain.</td>', 'Plain.', '2005-06-22 18:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476179, 190590, 37875, '<td valign="top">Photo appears to be slightly out of focus?</td>', 'Photo appears to be slightly out of focus?', '2005-06-22 18:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476181, 193026, 9478, '<td valign="top">I like the color, the light, and the reflection on the water. Good contrast between metal and nature.</td>', 'I like the color, the light, and the reflection on the water. Good contrast between metal and nature.', '2005-06-22 18:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476182, 192841, 37719, '<td valign="top">The blood is obviously ketchup - hurts the image.  The lightning may be ok, but the city lights on the right remove it from your context.  To be more correct, your ''nail'' should not be pointing down as you would slip off - one of those technical things.  At first look I thought distasteful to be honest.  At second and third look, the same.  It boiled down to the technicals on this one.</td>', 'The blood is obviously ketchup - hurts the image.  The lightning may be ok, but the city lights on the right remove it from your context.  To be more correct, your ''nail'' should not be pointing down as you would slip off - one of those technical things.  At first look I thought distasteful to be honest.  At second and third look, the same.  It boiled down to the technicals on this one.', '2005-06-22 18:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476184, 192342, 37875, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Like the fluid feel to this photo, and the absence of color.</td>', 'Very nice.  Like the fluid feel to this photo, and the absence of color.', '2005-06-22 18:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476185, 192744, 37719, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Need I say more?</td>', 'Great image!  Need I say more?', '2005-06-22 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476186, 192809, 37875, '<td valign="top">Cute concept!</td>', 'Cute concept!', '2005-06-22 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476187, 192054, 33732, '<td valign="top">Yes.  This must have been hard.  You used part of the subject.  I used all the subject on something similiar.  Looks like flash fill.  This is hard without extra light.</td>', 'Yes.  This must have been hard.  You used part of the subject.  I used all the subject on something similiar.  Looks like flash fill.  This is hard without extra light.', '2005-06-22 18:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476188, 192342, 9478, '<td valign="top">It seems almost drown! Good shot.</td>', 'It seems almost drown! Good shot.', '2005-06-22 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476189, 192761, 29601, '<td valign="top">i like the sepia tones to this.  very fitting for the subject.</td>', 'i like the sepia tones to this.  very fitting for the subject.', '2005-06-22 18:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476190, 194061, 37719, '<td valign="top">I think I would have appreciated this more without the people.  It is a very interesting photo for sure.  In some context I am sure the people would be ok.  But they just distract me from getting lost in the view of the image.  I am constantly drawn to them and not the creative perspective.</td>', 'I think I would have appreciated this more without the people.  It is a very interesting photo for sure.  In some context I am sure the people would be ok.  But they just distract me from getting lost in the view of the image.  I am constantly drawn to them and not the creative perspective.', '2005-06-22 18:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476192, 190993, 37875, '<td valign="top">Photo appears to be a bit washed out with the reds and greens.  I would have liked to see this photo with less grass in foreground.</td>', 'Photo appears to be a bit washed out with the reds and greens.  I would have liked to see this photo with less grass in foreground.', '2005-06-22 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476193, 193991, 39653, '<td valign="top">Somehow disturbing.</td>', 'Somehow disturbing.', '2005-06-22 18:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476194, 194040, 37875, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo.  I like the reflections and the focus on the mouthpiece.</td>', 'beautiful photo.  I like the reflections and the focus on the mouthpiece.', '2005-06-22 18:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476195, 194036, 37719, '<td valign="top">Looking at this for the third time now I know what it is that bothers me - it looks way oversharpened in sme parts and left alone in others. The detail looks applied rather than shot.</td>', 'Looking at this for the third time now I know what it is that bothers me - it looks way oversharpened in sme parts and left alone in others. The detail looks applied rather than shot.', '2005-06-22 18:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476196, 194082, 37875, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of sawblades!  Hard to tell they are metal.</td>', 'Interesting use of sawblades!  Hard to tell they are metal.', '2005-06-22 18:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476198, 192870, 39075, '<td valign="top">Great shot.   The sepia tone is fantastic.  I love the detail and the way it reaches into the unknown.  I was so taken by the bridge.  I almost did not see the people.</td>', 'Great shot.   The sepia tone is fantastic.  I love the detail and the way it reaches into the unknown.  I was so taken by the bridge.  I almost did not see the people.', '2005-06-22 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
