(1476205, 192054, 37875, '<td valign="top">Bold geometry and contrast in the ceiling, but I don''t think the angle of the shot is ideal...everything''s facing away from the viewer.</td>', 'Bold geometry and contrast in the ceiling, but I don''t think the angle of the shot is ideal...everything''s facing away from the viewer.', '2005-06-22 18:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
