(1476213, 194077, 37875, '<td valign="top">Like the player in the reflection of the bell!  I would have liked to see a different lighting or background or something, though.  The whole picture seems to want to be just a bit darker for a jazzier effect...wish I was techier so I could better express what I mean...sorry!  : (</td>', 'Like the player in the reflection of the bell!  I would have liked to see a different lighting or background or something, though.  The whole picture seems to want to be just a bit darker for a jazzier effect...wish I was techier so I could better express what I mean...sorry!  : (', '2005-06-22 18:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
