(1476314, 192968, 39075, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp detail in the forground and the way it slowly fades as you go back.  Should be cropped just a bit more.  you can see the end in the top left corner.  It ruines the endlessness.</td>', 'I like the sharp detail in the forground and the way it slowly fades as you go back.  Should be cropped just a bit more.  you can see the end in the top left corner.  It ruines the endlessness.', '2005-06-22 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
