(1476754, 192557, 1647, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  What is it?  Where is it?  I''m guessing it''s just art, but it looks like an awesome futuristic roller coaster.  It''s a shame you couldn''t get a clear blue sky for the background - would have really bought the photo to life</td>', 'Awesome.  What is it?  Where is it?  I''m guessing it''s just art, but it looks like an awesome futuristic roller coaster.  It''s a shame you couldn''t get a clear blue sky for the background - would have really bought the photo to life', '2005-06-22 21:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476756, 193932, 1647, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometry, and one of few occaisions where the border really helps complete the image</td>', 'Interesting geometry, and one of few occaisions where the border really helps complete the image', '2005-06-22 21:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476757, 192801, 36495, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2005-06-22 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
