(1476765, 192714, 36141, '<td valign="top">I truly think you should''ve leveled the street. Though the concept is very nice, it''s giving me a headache to look at it, because it''s just too much. That''s the reason I rate it a 4.</td>', 'I truly think you should''ve leveled the street. Though the concept is very nice, it''s giving me a headache to look at it, because it''s just too much. That''s the reason I rate it a 4.', '2005-06-22 21:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
