(1476797, 192929, 36141, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what happened, did you resized it on purpose or was it an accident.<br/>I like it, but I would''ve liked it much better if it was a bit bigger. I''ll rate it a 7 anyway.</td>', 'Don''t know what happened, did you resized it on purpose or was it an accident.I like it, but I would''ve liked it much better if it was a bit bigger. I''ll rate it a 7 anyway.', '2005-06-22 21:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
