(1476806, 194071, 36141, '<td valign="top">I don''t know much about techniques, but to me it seems that this type of photo''s will look better if it was much sharper. I''ll rate it a 5.</td>', 'I don''t know much about techniques, but to me it seems that this type of photo''s will look better if it was much sharper. I''ll rate it a 5.', '2005-06-22 21:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476807, 192715, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great colors, textures and angles.  I like this type of shot a lot.</td>', 'Great colors, textures and angles.  I like this type of shot a lot.', '2005-06-22 21:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
