(1476821, 194078, 36141, '<td valign="top">When I look at this photo, all my eye is actually attracted to are the daisies, beautiful as they are, they take away the attention from the metal ''beam'' and that''s a pity I think, because I like the concept. Because it''s a beautiful photo I''ll rate it a 7 anyway.</td>', 'When I look at this photo, all my eye is actually attracted to are the daisies, beautiful as they are, they take away the attention from the metal ''beam'' and that''s a pity I think, because I like the concept. Because it''s a beautiful photo I''ll rate it a 7 anyway.', '2005-06-22 21:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476823, 191529, 15242, '<td valign="top">The focus appears to be off slightly and you should have moved that little leaf caught in the web.  With those two fixes I''d give it an 8.</td>', 'The focus appears to be off slightly and you should have moved that little leaf caught in the web.  With those two fixes I''d give it an 8.', '2005-06-22 21:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476824, 194101, 15242, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, well done.</td>', 'Cool concept, well done.', '2005-06-22 21:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476825, 192770, 36141, '<td valign="top">The concept is very nice, but I think this type of photo asks for extreem sharpness on the focussed part. I''ll rate it a 6.</td>', 'The concept is very nice, but I think this type of photo asks for extreem sharpness on the focussed part. I''ll rate it a 6.', '2005-06-22 21:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476830, 193950, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very plain, it needs something to make the photo unique.</td>', 'Very plain, it needs something to make the photo unique.', '2005-06-22 21:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476833, 192616, 15242, '<td valign="top">It could be good, but I''m having a very hard time seeing it.</td>', 'It could be good, but I''m having a very hard time seeing it.', '2005-06-22 21:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476834, 190676, 2195, '<td valign="top">I have absolutely no idea what this is, but I love the tones and composition.</td>', 'I have absolutely no idea what this is, but I love the tones and composition.', '2005-06-22 21:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476835, 193926, 35786, '<td valign="top">LOL you know there are some who haven''t seen it and are saying WHAT!?!</td>', 'LOL you know there are some who haven''t seen it and are saying WHAT!?!', '2005-06-22 21:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
