(1476849, 192984, 36141, '<td valign="top">Several things to comment on in this photo. First: you should always level your horizon, I get the feeling it''s rather tilted. Second: the metal object is too small to play the leading role. I think it should''ve been the main object, while now it''s playing the second fiddle in a scenery photo. Therefor I''ll rate it a 4</td>', 'Several things to comment on in this photo. First: you should always level your horizon, I get the feeling it''s rather tilted. Second: the metal object is too small to play the leading role. I think it should''ve been the main object, while now it''s playing the second fiddle in a scenery photo. Therefor I''ll rate it a 4', '2005-06-22 21:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476850, 193169, 15242, '<td valign="top">THe colors and shapes are interesting, but I have no clue what it is.</td>', 'THe colors and shapes are interesting, but I have no clue what it is.', '2005-06-22 21:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476852, 193493, 15242, '<td valign="top">Crop off the sky on the top and bring out the red a little more and it''s a 10 for me.</td>', 'Crop off the sky on the top and bring out the red a little more and it''s a 10 for me.', '2005-06-22 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476858, 190956, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very snapshot-ish.  The photo would be better without the car.  Maybe you are trying too hard to meet the challenge and not hard enough to take a great photo?</td>', 'Very snapshot-ish.  The photo would be better without the car.  Maybe you are trying too hard to meet the challenge and not hard enough to take a great photo?', '2005-06-22 21:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476859, 193178, 33947, '<td valign="top">Needs more visual clarity...I''m not sure what I''m seeing.</td>', 'Needs more visual clarity...I''m not sure what I''m seeing.', '2005-06-22 21:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476860, 192443, 36141, '<td valign="top">If you had left out the eyes, it would''ve been a photo with a marvellous structure.<br/>Though there''s a lot of metal, the eyes are too distracting for me. I''ll rate it a 5.</td>', 'If you had left out the eyes, it would''ve been a photo with a marvellous structure.Though there''s a lot of metal, the eyes are too distracting for me. I''ll rate it a 5.', '2005-06-22 21:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
