(1476903, 190622, 34556, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great subject. The path in the backgorund is distracting. I would suggest either getting very low so it is not in the shot or moving so that it becomes a leading line to the main subject. The time of day did not do you any favours, early or late would have provided better shadows and a warmer light. I still like the shot, these two items would make it much better. You might want to try and do a reshoot and see what you come up with.</td>', 'This looks like a great subject. The path in the backgorund is distracting. I would suggest either getting very low so it is not in the shot or moving so that it becomes a leading line to the main subject. The time of day did not do you any favours, early or late would have provided better shadows and a warmer light. I still like the shot, these two items would make it much better. You might want to try and do a reshoot and see what you come up with.', '2005-06-22 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
