(1477497, 190816, 22379, '<td valign="top">OMG! You wouldn''t believe how much i love this image. I''m not entirely sure why, but it just smacked me in the mouth as WOW!  I am shocked that i am so in awe of (let''s face it) such a mediocre every day scene. You have really pulled something wonderful out of such a usually mundane setting!  Angle and perspective play a lot into it - the punk guy adds that extra wham. I dunno. I am rambling. I hope this wins!</td>', 'OMG! You wouldn''t believe how much i love this image. I''m not entirely sure why, but it just smacked me in the mouth as WOW!  I am shocked that i am so in awe of (let''s face it) such a mediocre every day scene. You have really pulled something wonderful out of such a usually mundane setting!  Angle and perspective play a lot into it - the punk guy adds that extra wham. I dunno. I am rambling. I hope this wins!', '2005-06-23 03:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
