(1477550, 192464, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great textures and interesting colours.  In my opinion it seems a shame the top of the metal object has not been included.  I still like the image though, good job.</td>', 'Great textures and interesting colours.  In my opinion it seems a shame the top of the metal object has not been included.  I still like the image though, good job.', '2005-06-23 03:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
