(1477578, 192970, 7570, '<td valign="top">the tracks curve on the bottom of the photo tells me you didnt stood on the train tracks to get this photo... phew! i like this photo but note the slight rotation.</td>', 'the tracks curve on the bottom of the photo tells me you didnt stood on the train tracks to get this photo... phew! i like this photo but note the slight rotation.', '2005-06-23 04:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
