(1477618, 193993, 37380, '<td valign="top">The dark vertical bar in the background is a bit of a distraction. Cropping that out would make this great photo absolutely awesome. Lighting looks perfect and the bronze hues really jump out at you. Well done.</td>', 'The dark vertical bar in the background is a bit of a distraction. Cropping that out would make this great photo absolutely awesome. Lighting looks perfect and the bronze hues really jump out at you. Well done.', '2005-06-23 06:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
