(1477693, 192933, 28801, '<td valign="top">A lovely sunset and beautiful composition. I am sure there is a lot of metal here but that is implied rather than depicted in the picture.</td>', 'A lovely sunset and beautiful composition. I am sure there is a lot of metal here but that is implied rather than depicted in the picture.', '2005-06-23 08:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477714, 192557, 7478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, actually looks good here with grey skies, seen it with nice clear blue late fall blue skies and looks great like that too. My office was 15 floors up from here for about 13 months, won''t disclose location but a cool place. Like your shot!<br/>CC</td>', 'Nice shot, actually looks good here with grey skies, seen it with nice clear blue late fall blue skies and looks great like that too. My office was 15 floors up from here for about 13 months, won''t disclose location but a cool place. Like your shot!CC', '2005-06-23 08:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477728, 192740, 37719, '<td valign="top">Would have been better without the straw.</td>', 'Would have been better without the straw.', '2005-06-23 08:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477732, 192287, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Love the textures!  Usually people would look at this as an eyesore and move around it to get the image.  This is great.  Crop, composition, DOF, POV all work for me. 8 - will check back later on a CRT for better evaluation. On a crt still looks great.  On second pass - 9.  Could use just a hair of brightness/contrast.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Love the textures!  Usually people would look at this as an eyesore and move around it to get the image.  This is great.  Crop, composition, DOF, POV all work for me. 8 - will check back later on a CRT for better evaluation. On a crt still looks great.  On second pass - 9.  Could use just a hair of brightness/contrast.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-23 08:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477735, 193166, 34192, '<td valign="top">love that the door is offset - not shot straight on - gives the image more character. I owuld have cropped it just a little less tightly to make that offset even more noticeable.  Needs a little bright/contrast but not too much, in my opinion. Love the colors - the rust plays extremely well with the blue.  8 from me - good luck in the challenge!  BTW - it always amuses me to see wooden frames on metal doors.  Kind of defeating the purpose, yes?  :) And surrounded by granite even!</td>', 'love that the door is offset - not shot straight on - gives the image more character. I owuld have cropped it just a little less tightly to make that offset even more noticeable.  Needs a little bright/contrast but not too much, in my opinion. Love the colors - the rust plays extremely well with the blue.  8 from me - good luck in the challenge!  BTW - it always amuses me to see wooden frames on metal doors.  Kind of defeating the purpose, yes?  :) And surrounded by granite even!', '2005-06-23 08:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477736, 193082, 34192, '<td valign="top">this is cool - steam iron.  Irrelevent - love the lighting - I believe that makes the image. 8 from me - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'this is cool - steam iron.  Irrelevent - love the lighting - I believe that makes the image. 8 from me - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-23 08:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477740, 192666, 34192, '<td valign="top">this is one of my favorites in the challenge.  How could anyone not love this image!  Hmmm, the following are options but not neccesarily the only way to go... POV could be differnt from the ground - make the fridge into a monlolith bigger than the mountain behind it.  Move to the right so you can crop out the left a little.  Wait for a dazzling sunset then have the fridge block out the sun. and a 100 other things.  This is so cool. I love juxtaposed absurdities.  Shame its reality. 10 from me - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'this is one of my favorites in the challenge.  How could anyone not love this image!  Hmmm, the following are options but not neccesarily the only way to go... POV could be differnt from the ground - make the fridge into a monlolith bigger than the mountain behind it.  Move to the right so you can crop out the left a little.  Wait for a dazzling sunset then have the fridge block out the sun. and a 100 other things.  This is so cool. I love juxtaposed absurdities.  Shame its reality. 10 from me - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-23 09:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477742, 192761, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Crop, composition, DOV, POV all great.  Even the balance works - the white against the black.  Love the tones - the hint of red.  10 from me - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow.  Crop, composition, DOV, POV all great.  Even the balance works - the white against the black.  Love the tones - the hint of red.  10 from me - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-23 09:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477743, 192803, 33732, '<td valign="top">Looks scientific.  I like it.  Closer on the subject croping out some of the light source would help.  If I know what it is, I don''t need the rest.</td>', 'Looks scientific.  I like it.  Closer on the subject croping out some of the light source would help.  If I know what it is, I don''t need the rest.', '2005-06-23 09:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
