(1477801, 192904, 9073, '<td valign="top">Not a pretty subject. One might argue that guns are ''born to protect''. However, I''ll try and put my views on guns aside and see the photo as a photo. There''s a very distracting line at the top, and I''m not sure why the right side is clipped. The blue hue helps to bring out the coldness of the metal, but I feel that it''s been overdone. Finally, the shadow under the object is not appealing. 4</td>', 'Not a pretty subject. One might argue that guns are ''born to protect''. However, I''ll try and put my views on guns aside and see the photo as a photo. There''s a very distracting line at the top, and I''m not sure why the right side is clipped. The blue hue helps to bring out the coldness of the metal, but I feel that it''s been overdone. Finally, the shadow under the object is not appealing. 4', '2005-06-23 09:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477803, 191582, 38925, '<td valign="top">this is very nice, the lighting effect was amazing</td>', 'this is very nice, the lighting effect was amazing', '2005-06-23 09:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
