(1477807, 192968, 9073, '<td valign="top">Allow me to be blunt. I like the idea of the pattern resulting at the top of the frame coming out of the chaos in the foreground. However, the stray light particularly at the top interferes with this plan, as does the unnecessary light spots all through the shot. Two really negative points for me are the very top left corner, which should really have been cropped out and the black stains, which really should have been cleaned. 4</td>', 'Allow me to be blunt. I like the idea of the pattern resulting at the top of the frame coming out of the chaos in the foreground. However, the stray light particularly at the top interferes with this plan, as does the unnecessary light spots all through the shot. Two really negative points for me are the very top left corner, which should really have been cropped out and the black stains, which really should have been cleaned. 4', '2005-06-23 09:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477808, 193178, 33732, '<td valign="top">This is metal.  And the angle you shot is of interest.  The bright spots are somewhat distracting.  Underfoil half way.  And where is the camera?  Nice effect.</td>', 'This is metal.  And the angle you shot is of interest.  The bright spots are somewhat distracting.  Underfoil half way.  And where is the camera?  Nice effect.', '2005-06-23 09:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
