(1478041, 192674, 39144, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter with the background.</td>', 'Too much clutter with the background.', '2005-06-23 11:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478042, 192841, 36981, '<td valign="top">Ew.  Too gross for me, and blood looks remarkably like ketchup.  The skyline in the back on the right doesn''t help.  I''m sorry!  This might have worked better with more interesting lighting - darken it up, add some shadows, skip the background photo.  Darkening it might make the "blood" look more realistic and the hand less healthy.  I''d also change the angle a little so that the hand and board aren''t comnpletely horizontal.</td>', 'Ew.  Too gross for me, and blood looks remarkably like ketchup.  The skyline in the back on the right doesn''t help.  I''m sorry!  This might have worked better with more interesting lighting - darken it up, add some shadows, skip the background photo.  Darkening it might make the "blood" look more realistic and the hand less healthy.  I''d also change the angle a little so that the hand and board aren''t comnpletely horizontal.', '2005-06-23 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
