(1478544, 192847, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge= 5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=2<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>Very pleasant to look at and even though your DOF has the other bolts blurred they aren''t to the point where they are annoying or not interesting to look at.  Colors and lighting are right on!<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge= 5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=2Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=1 Very pleasant to look at and even though your DOF has the other bolts blurred they aren''t to the point where they are annoying or not interesting to look at.  Colors and lighting are right on! Good luck', '2005-06-23 14:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478545, 194027, 36499, '<td valign="top">my goal is to comment on every photo in this challenge..heres urs..good luck..neat comp and good DOF but too much belly is showing for this dof...a crop to just above jeans would have made this a better photo IMHO</td>', 'my goal is to comment on every photo in this challenge..heres urs..good luck..neat comp and good DOF but too much belly is showing for this dof...a crop to just above jeans would have made this a better photo IMHO', '2005-06-23 14:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478548, 191212, 34759, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. It''s very cluttered though. Cropping the stuff on the right out might have improved it, but it''s a very busy background also. Not sure if a taking the shot from a different angle would have improved the background.</td>', 'Interesting shot. It''s very cluttered though. Cropping the stuff on the right out might have improved it, but it''s a very busy background also. Not sure if a taking the shot from a different angle would have improved the background.', '2005-06-23 14:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478550, 190704, 30817, '<td valign="top">This looks so nice!  Beautiful presentation ... just beautiful! I like the industrialized centering. Some who blindly believe centering is ALWAYS bad might chime in here.  But I feel a picture crops itself by its elements. You alowed all components an equal voice here, as should have been. 9.</td>', 'This looks so nice!  Beautiful presentation ... just beautiful! I like the industrialized centering. Some who blindly believe centering is ALWAYS bad might chime in here.  But I feel a picture crops itself by its elements. You alowed all components an equal voice here, as should have been. 9.', '2005-06-23 14:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478551, 194106, 33732, '<td valign="top">Metal.  I am trying to connect with this.  The hidder image is neat.</td>', 'Metal.  I am trying to connect with this.  The hidder image is neat.', '2005-06-23 14:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478552, 192342, 36353, '<td valign="top">Metal is VERY hard to shoot well in a studio product situation like this. You pulled it off quite well. I''m guessing you used a brand new spoon? The edge lighting around the entire rim is quite well done. the spoon itself shows no visible blemishes (very hard to do with used utensils). Focus is a touch soft near the tip for me, I would have rather seen the handle be OOF more to correct this. The tone is also quite good. You cover a lot of zones in this shot.</td>', 'Metal is VERY hard to shoot well in a studio product situation like this. You pulled it off quite well. I''m guessing you used a brand new spoon? The edge lighting around the entire rim is quite well done. the spoon itself shows no visible blemishes (very hard to do with used utensils). Focus is a touch soft near the tip for me, I would have rather seen the handle be OOF more to correct this. The tone is also quite good. You cover a lot of zones in this shot.', '2005-06-23 14:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478553, 192716, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge= 5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=0<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0<br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>Not really intersting but lite nicely.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge= 5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=0Wow factor/uniqueness=0Attractiveness=1 Not really intersting but lite nicely. Good luck', '2005-06-23 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478556, 191558, 19025, '<td valign="top">would prefer to see more of the face on this.........and sharpen more. But I like the colors and the sky is great.  But had you taken 2 steps to the left of this statue, I''d say it would have been just right.  My opinion though.</td>', 'would prefer to see more of the face on this.........and sharpen more. But I like the colors and the sky is great.  But had you taken 2 steps to the left of this statue, I''d say it would have been just right.  My opinion though.', '2005-06-23 14:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
