(1478560, 192715, 30817, '<td valign="top">What a very nice abstract!  The textures, tones and shading are balanced so nicely as to give a feeling of a visual mobile hanging before me. 9.</td>', 'What a very nice abstract!  The textures, tones and shading are balanced so nicely as to give a feeling of a visual mobile hanging before me. 9.', '2005-06-23 14:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
