(1478564, 192587, 36499, '<td valign="top">my goal is to comment on every photo in this challenge..heres urs..good luck..photo is very small..please read the tutorial abot processing images for entry to avoid this problem in the future. good photo from what i can see but the description said : shiney metal,good conductor or electric: i feel u were going fo r more of a metal music approach which doesnt meet the challenge. its good to think "out of the box" but be prepared to have low scores as too "out of the box" thinking doesnt do well here. sorry..hope this helps</td>', 'my goal is to comment on every photo in this challenge..heres urs..good luck..photo is very small..please read the tutorial abot processing images for entry to avoid this problem in the future. good photo from what i can see but the description said : shiney metal,good conductor or electric: i feel u were going fo r more of a metal music approach which doesnt meet the challenge. its good to think "out of the box" but be prepared to have low scores as too "out of the box" thinking doesnt do well here. sorry..hope this helps', '2005-06-23 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
