(1479546, 192315, 21478, '<td valign="top">The wizard looks a little flat - perhaps the stright on lighting did this. A little more side lighting and it would add some depth I think. Good job with the placement on the background, but again, I think you could have cropped with the wizard to the left of the shot  a little more to have him staring "into" the shot. Applying the "rule of thirds" here possibly would have made the image more interesting.</td>', 'The wizard looks a little flat - perhaps the stright on lighting did this. A little more side lighting and it would add some depth I think. Good job with the placement on the background, but again, I think you could have cropped with the wizard to the left of the shot  a little more to have him staring "into" the shot. Applying the "rule of thirds" here possibly would have made the image more interesting.', '2005-06-23 19:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
