(1480081, 190557, 37234, '<td valign="top">Why a 2? Because the subject (building''s I presume) are being blocked by the bottom of the window, and nothing in the shot inspires me to think it''s anything beyond a common snapshot. I know that probably sounds mean, and I don''t mean it that way - but a submission for a contest should be inspired by something, IMHO.</td>', 'Why a 2? Because the subject (building''s I presume) are being blocked by the bottom of the window, and nothing in the shot inspires me to think it''s anything beyond a common snapshot. I know that probably sounds mean, and I don''t mean it that way - but a submission for a contest should be inspired by something, IMHO.', '2005-06-24 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
