(1480298, 194086, 25678, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this picture.  Technically, I think a bit more depth of focus would be good.  I understand the emphasis is on the handle, but the way it''s cropped you notice the out of focus part of the blade more than you notice the hilt.  Also, a bit more light on teh handle to draw attention to the detailing would help as well.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this picture.  Technically, I think a bit more depth of focus would be good.  I understand the emphasis is on the handle, but the way it''s cropped you notice the out of focus part of the blade more than you notice the hilt.  Also, a bit more light on teh handle to draw attention to the detailing would help as well.', '2005-06-24 02:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1480300, 192037, 39752, '<td valign="top">Very good colours. The whole wire in focus would have been better. Interesting pic tough. I like minimalism.</td>', 'Very good colours. The whole wire in focus would have been better. Interesting pic tough. I like minimalism.', '2005-06-24 02:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
