(1482025, 191494, 30817, '<td valign="top">Great shot of some very old steel. Like the leading lines from LL up toward top center.  The sprinkle of light is just right. 9</td>', 'Great shot of some very old steel. Like the leading lines from LL up toward top center.  The sprinkle of light is just right. 9', '2005-06-24 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482026, 192741, 30817, '<td valign="top">Color correcting is allowed in basic editing. Would have been worth it to take the time to lower the temperature of this shot.</td>', 'Color correcting is allowed in basic editing. Would have been worth it to take the time to lower the temperature of this shot.', '2005-06-24 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482041, 192740, 30817, '<td valign="top">Just curious, no criticism; but why didn''t you just pick the straw out of the frame before you shot? I guess you wanted it in. But due to its bright color and non-conformity to the environment, it immediately becomes the subject, regardless of your title.</td>', 'Just curious, no criticism; but why didn''t you just pick the straw out of the frame before you shot? I guess you wanted it in. But due to its bright color and non-conformity to the environment, it immediately becomes the subject, regardless of your title.', '2005-06-24 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482046, 194083, 33732, '<td valign="top">I looked at this and voted on it last.  Silver cooling to me.  This is metal.  It is a setup but l like what you have done.  That flow with the shine and impurities makes the photo.  Lighting would be difficult.  Exposure is good to see those colors.  I am impressed with the technique to set this up and the skill to capture it.  Good luck.</td>', 'I looked at this and voted on it last.  Silver cooling to me.  This is metal.  It is a setup but l like what you have done.  That flow with the shine and impurities makes the photo.  Lighting would be difficult.  Exposure is good to see those colors.  I am impressed with the technique to set this up and the skill to capture it.  Good luck.', '2005-06-24 20:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482048, 192871, 30817, '<td valign="top">Originality in perspective choice is a winner with me. I like your non-traditional thinking. The best of the bike shots I have seen. 9</td>', 'Originality in perspective choice is a winner with me. I like your non-traditional thinking. The best of the bike shots I have seen. 9', '2005-06-24 20:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482053, 193032, 30817, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, clever title, clever photographer. Nicely accomplished. 9</td>', 'Clever shot, clever title, clever photographer. Nicely accomplished. 9', '2005-06-24 20:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
