(1482230, 193951, 39075, '<td valign="top">Great use of light.  I like the way the sparks shower down on the tools.  Good reflections.</td>', 'Great use of light.  I like the way the sparks shower down on the tools.  Good reflections.', '2005-06-24 23:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482241, 193178, 39075, '<td valign="top">I think the foil is overkill.  A plian background would have made the balls stand out more.</td>', 'I think the foil is overkill.  A plian background would have made the balls stand out more.', '2005-06-24 23:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482243, 193881, 39075, '<td valign="top">I like the use of relection in the background.</td>', 'I like the use of relection in the background.', '2005-06-24 23:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482245, 192936, 39075, '<td valign="top">Good angle.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'Good angle.  Nice DOF.', '2005-06-24 23:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482246, 192311, 33736, '<td valign="top">If this were really "real", it''d be colored reddish - my scarred fingertips will attest to that.<br/> <br/>Mom went back to work, and I became the family cook - Scalloped Potatoes and Ham was in the weekly rotation.<br/> <br/>The flat look of the image lowers my score (along with the coloring.)   There was a high potential for DOF ("climbing" the holes - sharp angle from bottom.)   And a high potential for higher dynamics by using the corner.  I''m assuming that this was the "Tower" style.<br/> <br/>But the shine and reflection (showing your mettle for metal) are terrific.  6</td>', 'If this were really "real", it''d be colored reddish - my scarred fingertips will attest to that. Mom went back to work, and I became the family cook - Scalloped Potatoes and Ham was in the weekly rotation. The flat look of the image lowers my score (along with the coloring.)   There was a high potential for DOF ("climbing" the holes - sharp angle from bottom.)   And a high potential for higher dynamics by using the corner.  I''m assuming that this was the "Tower" style. But the shine and reflection (showing your mettle for metal) are terrific.  6', '2005-06-24 23:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482247, 192258, 39075, '<td valign="top">Simple and Clean.</td>', 'Simple and Clean.', '2005-06-24 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482251, 194002, 39075, '<td valign="top">Good lines.  Good DOF.</td>', 'Good lines.  Good DOF.', '2005-06-24 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482252, 194012, 38078, '<td valign="top">i like the balance of the photo but the subject doesn''t hold my interest</td>', 'i like the balance of the photo but the subject doesn''t hold my interest', '2005-06-24 23:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482254, 192138, 39075, '<td valign="top">Good angle.</td>', 'Good angle.', '2005-06-24 23:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482256, 192578, 33736, '<td valign="top">I think I wouldn''t have shown so much of the pan''s sides - especially from the top.  As it stands, all the edges detract from the contrasts between the metal and the stone.  The water drops are a nice touch.    6</td>', 'I think I wouldn''t have shown so much of the pan''s sides - especially from the top.  As it stands, all the edges detract from the contrasts between the metal and the stone.  The water drops are a nice touch.    6', '2005-06-24 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482257, 191280, 38078, '<td valign="top">i don''t fish so i have no idea what this is.  so, judging as a work of art, it''s a bit too busy.  a more simple background may have been more effective.</td>', 'i don''t fish so i have no idea what this is.  so, judging as a work of art, it''s a bit too busy.  a more simple background may have been more effective.', '2005-06-24 23:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
