(1482796, 190816, 10833, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  When I first saw it, I thought it was a "moving sidewalk", then I realized it was an escalator.  The POV adds the extra interest and the metals do not have "blown out" glare.<br/> <br/>The only distracting part is the brightness at the ''end'' of the escalators and the lighting - but I found that only minor.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like this shot.  When I first saw it, I thought it was a "moving sidewalk", then I realized it was an escalator.  The POV adds the extra interest and the metals do not have "blown out" glare. The only distracting part is the brightness at the ''end'' of the escalators and the lighting - but I found that only minor. ', '2005-06-25 10:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482797, 192908, 30817, '<td valign="top">Great lines and textures pull me right into this scene. The top crop keeps the syes low, which in this case is a good idea. 9.</td>', 'Great lines and textures pull me right into this scene. The top crop keeps the syes low, which in this case is a good idea. 9.', '2005-06-25 10:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
