(1482801, 194093, 10833, '<td valign="top">Very gritty (in a good way) photograph.  The bottom right is a bit distracting, and I would have liked to seen the left link line fully.<br/> <br/>The overall photograph works well with the title.</td>', 'Very gritty (in a good way) photograph.  The bottom right is a bit distracting, and I would have liked to seen the left link line fully. The overall photograph works well with the title.', '2005-06-25 11:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482802, 191175, 30817, '<td valign="top">Circles, crescents, triangles and straight lines; you''ve got it all here! And those textures are almost tangible. Well made ode to a bygone day in abstract form.  9.</td>', 'Circles, crescents, triangles and straight lines; you''ve got it all here! And those textures are almost tangible. Well made ode to a bygone day in abstract form.  9.', '2005-06-25 11:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482804, 191549, 10833, '<td valign="top">I''m always amazed at you folks who can get these types of water shots.<br/> <br/>The only drawbacks I see are that the main thing I see in this picture is ''water'', not ''metal''.</td>', 'I''m always amazed at you folks who can get these types of water shots. The only drawbacks I see are that the main thing I see in this picture is ''water'', not ''metal''.', '2005-06-25 11:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482805, 190690, 10833, '<td valign="top">Cute Idea, you get an extra point for that.<br/> <br/>I would have went another route with the lightness/contrst, but I like that you went with a simple background.</td>', 'Cute Idea, you get an extra point for that. I would have went another route with the lightness/contrst, but I like that you went with a simple background.', '2005-06-25 11:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482806, 191379, 30817, '<td valign="top">You put water, reflections and rainbow colors into this shot; all the attention devices that normally spike a photograph. But still it is a shot of spoons ..... cereal, soup and jello spoons.   Hint: forks are more photogenic and percieved as sexier in 90% of the cases. 7.</td>', 'You put water, reflections and rainbow colors into this shot; all the attention devices that normally spike a photograph. But still it is a shot of spoons ..... cereal, soup and jello spoons.   Hint: forks are more photogenic and percieved as sexier in 90% of the cases. 7.', '2005-06-25 11:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482808, 192647, 10833, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is good, but I would have liked it more if it didn''t seem it was in the shadows. (Maybe re-take it at a different time in the day?)</td>', 'I think the composition is good, but I would have liked it more if it didn''t seem it was in the shadows. (Maybe re-take it at a different time in the day?)', '2005-06-25 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482810, 193887, 10833, '<td valign="top">You get creativity points.<br/> <br/>Only item I found distracting was the fact that all of the metal surfaces are reflecting the blue lighting, except the "bowl" of the spoon.  The overall effect is that I can''t gauge if the "blue" areas are the main focus, or the bowl of the spoon.</td>', 'You get creativity points. Only item I found distracting was the fact that all of the metal surfaces are reflecting the blue lighting, except the "bowl" of the spoon.  The overall effect is that I can''t gauge if the "blue" areas are the main focus, or the bowl of the spoon.', '2005-06-25 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482812, 193934, 10833, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think the oven racks are distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think the oven racks are distracting.', '2005-06-25 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482813, 192894, 30817, '<td valign="top">A bridge ... a river .... a sunset; what''s not to like?  A darkly cluttered foreground ... kills the feel of the nicer components of this shot. You could have cropped 3/4 of the bottom vegetation and still kept the sense of place, while complimenting everything above it.  As is, the viewers eyes are instantly pulled downward, just where they need not be. 6.</td>', 'A bridge ... a river .... a sunset; what''s not to like?  A darkly cluttered foreground ... kills the feel of the nicer components of this shot. You could have cropped 3/4 of the bottom vegetation and still kept the sense of place, while complimenting everything above it.  As is, the viewers eyes are instantly pulled downward, just where they need not be. 6.', '2005-06-25 11:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482814, 193926, 10833, '<td valign="top">LOL!  You get extra points for making me laugh... (please dont take that in a bad way).<br/> <br/>You made an effort to make a liability (reflections) into an asset on this picture. You get an extra point for that.<br/> <br/>Only things I find distracting is the carpet (I might have tried this with a different backdrop) and the extra items in the room.</td>', 'LOL!  You get extra points for making me laugh... (please dont take that in a bad way). You made an effort to make a liability (reflections) into an asset on this picture. You get an extra point for that. Only things I find distracting is the carpet (I might have tried this with a different backdrop) and the extra items in the room.', '2005-06-25 11:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482815, 191429, 30817, '<td valign="top">Nice fine!  Great lines, details and textures.  The limited DOF is your friend here. 9.</td>', 'Nice fine!  Great lines, details and textures.  The limited DOF is your friend here. 9.', '2005-06-25 11:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
