(1482826, 191490, 10833, '<td valign="top">The only thing I could fault you on is the lack of the full shadow on the left.  But I guess one could argue that the shadow would distract from the main focus.</td>', 'The only thing I could fault you on is the lack of the full shadow on the left.  But I guess one could argue that the shadow would distract from the main focus.', '2005-06-25 11:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
