(1482863, 190924, 30817, '<td valign="top">Hurray for someone being unafraid to think outside the box and center a shot now and again.  Great symmetry with just enough light variation to keep the parts interesting. Don''t concern yourself too much with any criticism you may get on this; you did a fine, fine job of interpreting this scene. 9.</td>', 'Hurray for someone being unafraid to think outside the box and center a shot now and again.  Great symmetry with just enough light variation to keep the parts interesting. Don''t concern yourself too much with any criticism you may get on this; you did a fine, fine job of interpreting this scene. 9.', '2005-06-25 11:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
