(1482868, 194106, 30817, '<td valign="top">Looks like the death mask of Colonel Sanders. ..... is it?  7 for sneaking in there..</td>', 'Looks like the death mask of Colonel Sanders. ..... is it?  7 for sneaking in there..', '2005-06-25 11:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482869, 192307, 30817, '<td valign="top">Ohhh.... you got it!  What a terrific composition with linear, tonal and color balance all working together to describe the potential energy available to this subject. It is like a massive ballet. My choice for a ribbon.</td>', 'Ohhh.... you got it!  What a terrific composition with linear, tonal and color balance all working together to describe the potential energy available to this subject. It is like a massive ballet. My choice for a ribbon.', '2005-06-25 11:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482871, 192939, 30817, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You found gold here!  This is a terrific shot. Well composed with simple yet bold elements; each one reinforcing the next in such a way as to take the viewer on a left to right visual odyssey then turn them around and send the eyes back the other way. This is a visual representation of an echo.  Putting in "favorites" as my pick to win.</td>', 'Wow!  You found gold here!  This is a terrific shot. Well composed with simple yet bold elements; each one reinforcing the next in such a way as to take the viewer on a left to right visual odyssey then turn them around and send the eyes back the other way. This is a visual representation of an echo.  Putting in "favorites" as my pick to win.', '2005-06-25 11:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482876, 194078, 30817, '<td valign="top">What a pleasantly contrasting composition. Nice juxtaposition. So much good balance at work here that the harmonies just sing a lovely melody. My pick for one of the ribbons and adding to my favorites.</td>', 'What a pleasantly contrasting composition. Nice juxtaposition. So much good balance at work here that the harmonies just sing a lovely melody. My pick for one of the ribbons and adding to my favorites.', '2005-06-25 11:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482968, 193986, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  wonder how it would have  looked as a vertical?  good catch in any case.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  wonder how it would have  looked as a vertical?  good catch in any case.', '2005-06-25 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482970, 191212, 14476, '<td valign="top">while i like your concept on this one, there''s a bit too much in your image to try to understand.  it helps to simplify, when possible.</td>', 'while i like your concept on this one, there''s a bit too much in your image to try to understand.  it helps to simplify, when possible.', '2005-06-25 12:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482976, 192907, 14476, '<td valign="top">You gotta be kidding.  Is THAT what they look like these days?  <br/>Oh, btw, nice image.</td>', 'You gotta be kidding.  Is THAT what they look like these days?  Oh, btw, nice image.', '2005-06-25 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
