(1482994, 191465, 34633, '<td valign="top">i like the abstract nature of the composition, the balance of lines, but I am not so fond of the color, specifically the tone -- it screams fluorescent ligghting to me, which gives me headaches in real life. Maybe one way to bring out the structure and solve the color problem would be to go black and white with this picture.</td>', 'i like the abstract nature of the composition, the balance of lines, but I am not so fond of the color, specifically the tone -- it screams fluorescent ligghting to me, which gives me headaches in real life. Maybe one way to bring out the structure and solve the color problem would be to go black and white with this picture.', '2005-06-25 13:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482996, 192927, 34633, '<td valign="top">beautiful color and toning, perfect exposure. maybe DOF could have been greater to include a clear line towards the bottom left. Great job!</td>', 'beautiful color and toning, perfect exposure. maybe DOF could have been greater to include a clear line towards the bottom left. Great job!', '2005-06-25 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
