(1483454, 192747, 14476, '<td valign="top">...just metal ones to rust away.  Seriously, nice composition, and good use of darks and lights.</td>', '...just metal ones to rust away.  Seriously, nice composition, and good use of darks and lights.', '2005-06-25 20:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483456, 192587, 37234, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s just a snapshot of a dude in a Metallia T-shirt. Not terribly thought inspiring.</td>', 'Well, it''s just a snapshot of a dude in a Metallia T-shirt. Not terribly thought inspiring.', '2005-06-25 20:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483465, 192970, 30817, '<td valign="top">I like the energy and the anticipation in this photograph. One expects a second train to come out of the mist directly toward the camera on that right track at any second. The electrical lines add to that energy and to the contrast between frenetic top and serene bottom portions of this image. The light and dark balance is on the money as well. Centering works so good when all is in balance and a payoff is suggested at the core.... as is here.  9.</td>', 'I like the energy and the anticipation in this photograph. One expects a second train to come out of the mist directly toward the camera on that right track at any second. The electrical lines add to that energy and to the contrast between frenetic top and serene bottom portions of this image. The light and dark balance is on the money as well. Centering works so good when all is in balance and a payoff is suggested at the core.... as is here.  9.', '2005-06-25 20:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483467, 192564, 32513, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo with a smart framing. But to me the subject of this photo seems more like the leaves, the way it''s framed, and the contrasting colors all lead my eye to those leaves...not something you''d want for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a good photo with a smart framing. But to me the subject of this photo seems more like the leaves, the way it''s framed, and the contrasting colors all lead my eye to those leaves...not something you''d want for this challenge.', '2005-06-25 20:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483469, 193066, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is formula, but it is exact formula and you picked the correct components with which to pull it off. Those ovals that become crescents are hypnotic in their repetitive patterns.  The light/dark interplay also helps to sing a song of harmonious vibrations to the viewer.  Nothing daring, but well done nonetheless. 9.</td>', 'This is formula, but it is exact formula and you picked the correct components with which to pull it off. Those ovals that become crescents are hypnotic in their repetitive patterns.  The light/dark interplay also helps to sing a song of harmonious vibrations to the viewer.  Nothing daring, but well done nonetheless. 9.', '2005-06-25 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483470, 192682, 14476, '<td valign="top">You had a great subject here.  I''d have loved to see this unique object as an off-center composition and maybe a bit more ''full frame''   Good find, though.</td>', 'You had a great subject here.  I''d have loved to see this unique object as an off-center composition and maybe a bit more ''full frame''   Good find, though.', '2005-06-25 20:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
