(1483477, 191498, 32513, '<td valign="top">I think this might do better if you cropped out  the black section at the bottom of the picture. It doesn''t really seem to do much for the composition. Other than that, good job.</td>', 'I think this might do better if you cropped out  the black section at the bottom of the picture. It doesn''t really seem to do much for the composition. Other than that, good job.', '2005-06-25 20:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
