(1483935, 192587, 39111, '<td valign="top">caveat:  i''m a beginner.  that said...too small to really see what''s going on.  composition is sort of odd with almost his entire body in the image except his right ankle/foot with all the extra sky.</td>', 'caveat:  i''m a beginner.  that said...too small to really see what''s going on.  composition is sort of odd with almost his entire body in the image except his right ankle/foot with all the extra sky.', '2005-06-26 04:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
