(1483937, 194059, 39111, '<td valign="top">caveat:  i''m a beginner.  that said...the image is too small to really see what''s going on...i like the pattern on the dome but otherwise find very little interesting here.</td>', 'caveat:  i''m a beginner.  that said...the image is too small to really see what''s going on...i like the pattern on the dome but otherwise find very little interesting here.', '2005-06-26 04:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
