(1483941, 194061, 39553, '<td valign="top">Difficult to appreciate what you''re looking at... is this a building or something?</td>', 'Difficult to appreciate what you''re looking at... is this a building or something?', '2005-06-26 05:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
