(1485953, 192342, 24512, '<td valign="top">i''ve taken pics of spoons before, but not like this one.  Very well done. Everytime i take pics like this you see every tiny scratch and defect in the metal.  how did you get it so smooth looking?</td>', 'i''ve taken pics of spoons before, but not like this one.  Very well done. Everytime i take pics like this you see every tiny scratch and defect in the metal.  how did you get it so smooth looking?', '2005-06-27 09:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
