(1486711, 193159, 23053, '<td valign="top">This image is well done, perfectly balanced, and has nice coloring.  However, it almost has a static feel to it that I am put off by.  Also, the way the peak at the top of the ceiling is cut off make me want to scroll up higher...it just seems to interrupt the flow of the lines, which all tend toward the vertical.</td>', 'This image is well done, perfectly balanced, and has nice coloring.  However, it almost has a static feel to it that I am put off by.  Also, the way the peak at the top of the ceiling is cut off make me want to scroll up higher...it just seems to interrupt the flow of the lines, which all tend toward the vertical.', '2005-06-27 16:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
