(1487203, 193493, 30817, '<td valign="top">Someone could make some money selling those phone booths to private individuals for in the basement or in a party room.  Cool!  Nice shot with a lot of neat lines and colors.  8.</td>', 'Someone could make some money selling those phone booths to private individuals for in the basement or in a party room.  Cool!  Nice shot with a lot of neat lines and colors.  8.', '2005-06-27 21:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487204, 193938, 30817, '<td valign="top">Almost hypnotic composition.  This is one classy abstract.  Congratulations on a job well done!</td>', 'Almost hypnotic composition.  This is one classy abstract.  Congratulations on a job well done!', '2005-06-27 21:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487211, 192887, 30817, '<td valign="top">Would work very well for "Obsolete" challenge too! But you could not reshoot this one any better.  You captured the feeling even beyond the color and lines. The story is intense and complete in this fine composition. Great work on my kind of shot.</td>', 'Would work very well for "Obsolete" challenge too! But you could not reshoot this one any better.  You captured the feeling even beyond the color and lines. The story is intense and complete in this fine composition. Great work on my kind of shot.', '2005-06-27 21:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487217, 190983, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is a good macro and here is why: well defined focal point with multiple subjects (studs, taste buds, tongue contours), a sense of place in which the subject is located as indicated by the BG and the FG, excellent lighting and natural hues and tones, while the entire structure elicits an emotional response. For me the response reiterates my question; if someone feels they should add to the already high number of holes in the human body, why would it be inside the mouth and especially on the tongue? No one can see it and it MUST interfere with at least four normally unencumbered processes.  But after studying this image from a photographic POV for about 7 or 8 minutes, I can see why one would allow themselves this pleasure ..... they have lost their mind. 8.</td>', 'This is a good macro and here is why: well defined focal point with multiple subjects (studs, taste buds, tongue contours), a sense of place in which the subject is located as indicated by the BG and the FG, excellent lighting and natural hues and tones, while the entire structure elicits an emotional response. For me the response reiterates my question; if someone feels they should add to the already high number of holes in the human body, why would it be inside the mouth and especially on the tongue? No one can see it and it MUST interfere with at least four normally unencumbered processes.  But after studying this image from a photographic POV for about 7 or 8 minutes, I can see why one would allow themselves this pleasure ..... they have lost their mind. 8.', '2005-06-27 21:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487228, 192476, 30817, '<td valign="top">Lovely placement composition with just enough exposure of each object to suggest its purpose and value. Improvement might come from adjusting the temperature slightly cooler. The ruddy hue is warm and friendly, but it would be nice if the blade of the tri-square were a wee bit more metallic than wood-like in tonal texture. It seems almost greenish-yellow where it might affect more contrast and stand out better if slightly more bluish. 8.</td>', 'Lovely placement composition with just enough exposure of each object to suggest its purpose and value. Improvement might come from adjusting the temperature slightly cooler. The ruddy hue is warm and friendly, but it would be nice if the blade of the tri-square were a wee bit more metallic than wood-like in tonal texture. It seems almost greenish-yellow where it might affect more contrast and stand out better if slightly more bluish. 8.', '2005-06-27 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
