(1488125, 191204, 38838, '<td valign="top">Interesting, innovative, inspiring. Great presentation. Love the light reflecting off the helmet and the water, the varying depth of the water juxtaposed with the height of the helmet, the reddish tint of the sand (lower right) against the red on the helmet . . . . I could (but won''t) go on and on and on. Excellent photograph.</td>', 'Interesting, innovative, inspiring. Great presentation. Love the light reflecting off the helmet and the water, the varying depth of the water juxtaposed with the height of the helmet, the reddish tint of the sand (lower right) against the red on the helmet . . . . I could (but won''t) go on and on and on. Excellent photograph.', '2005-06-28 10:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488131, 193954, 39937, '<td valign="top">The angle of the shot is distracting...</td>', 'The angle of the shot is distracting...', '2005-06-28 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488138, 193174, 23356, '<td valign="top">A very striking image, I like this a lot. Great contrast between the rigid foreground and the much softer background. =9</td>', 'A very striking image, I like this a lot. Great contrast between the rigid foreground and the much softer background. =9', '2005-06-28 10:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488146, 192808, 39558, '<td valign="top">Great composition! Metal focal point sitting in a reflective pond like base. Trees (wood) in the backround adds a subliminal warmth along with the fantastic lighting. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-19 19:12:25.</i></td>', 'Great composition! Metal focal point sitting in a reflective pond like base. Trees (wood) in the backround adds a subliminal warmth along with the fantastic lighting. ', '2005-06-28 10:32:21.000000', '2006-05-19 20:12:25.000000', 1),
