(1488282, 191516, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>Very old item and perfectly colored, wish the lighting wasn''t quite so bright on the top left of the item but probably hard to control. For some reason, I like that it isn''t centered exactly top to bottom but is left to right.  Can''t wait to see what this is from.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0DOF/focus=1uniqueness=1Attractiveness=0 Very old item and perfectly colored, wish the lighting wasn''t quite so bright on the top left of the item but probably hard to control. For some reason, I like that it isn''t centered exactly top to bottom but is left to right.  Can''t wait to see what this is from. Good luck', '2005-06-28 11:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
