(1488295, 191486, 36353, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the selective desaturation does anything fo this shot personally. I think it actually detracts (within the framework of the challenge) as it sucks your attention away from the metal. Most certaily the metal is the main subject, yet I can''t really look at it because the sign and flag keep distracting me.</td>', 'I don''t think the selective desaturation does anything fo this shot personally. I think it actually detracts (within the framework of the challenge) as it sucks your attention away from the metal. Most certaily the metal is the main subject, yet I can''t really look at it because the sign and flag keep distracting me.', '2005-06-28 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
