(1488313, 192638, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=4<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>I''m going to have to mark down because I cannot be sure it is metal.  Looks a lot more like stone to me but I''m guessing it is old rusted off metal from a Chevy DK(?)  I think an image like this should show without a shadow of a doubt that it is metal.  I applaud you for going away from the norm by shooting the entire car but I think you went a little too far away.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=4Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=0Attractiveness=0 I''m going to have to mark down because I cannot be sure it is metal.  Looks a lot more like stone to me but I''m guessing it is old rusted off metal from a Chevy DK(?)  I think an image like this should show without a shadow of a doubt that it is metal.  I applaud you for going away from the norm by shooting the entire car but I think you went a little too far away. Good luck', '2005-06-28 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488315, 192919, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>Colors seem a little dull, maybe a slight curve adjustment can be done to fix it.  Crop of the wing and tail section seems odd but I understand you didn''t want the entire image in the middle just wonder if it could have worked somehow and kept the wing.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=0 Colors seem a little dull, maybe a slight curve adjustment can be done to fix it.  Crop of the wing and tail section seems odd but I understand you didn''t want the entire image in the middle just wonder if it could have worked somehow and kept the wing. Good luck', '2005-06-28 11:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488319, 190759, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>I like how the leaning of the post and ball seems to show it had to lean forward to get a good look at her.  Your DOF is perfect, might be able to do a slight curve or leveling to the colors on the right side but they are otherwise nice.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1uniqueness=1Attractiveness=0 I like how the leaning of the post and ball seems to show it had to lean forward to get a good look at her.  Your DOF is perfect, might be able to do a slight curve or leveling to the colors on the right side but they are otherwise nice. Good luck', '2005-06-28 11:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488322, 192832, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=0<br/>uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>Your size hurts you on this image by not allowing us to see as much detail.  If you chose this size because of the 150kb limits check your compression options and see if you can fit this with 640 as your size.  PM me if you need help.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=0uniqueness=1Attractiveness=0 Your size hurts you on this image by not allowing us to see as much detail.  If you chose this size because of the 150kb limits check your compression options and see if you can fit this with 640 as your size.  PM me if you need help. Good luck', '2005-06-28 11:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
