(1488578, 192863, 39193, '<td valign="top">I really love the idea..and you noticing / capturing the scene so well with those lines, her position and stare, etc. are wonderful..but the quality of the photo..smuge marks and that brownish color just really hold it back from being great to me..<br/> <br/>still..great work! 8</td>', 'I really love the idea..and you noticing / capturing the scene so well with those lines, her position and stare, etc. are wonderful..but the quality of the photo..smuge marks and that brownish color just really hold it back from being great to me.. still..great work! 8', '2005-06-28 14:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
