(1488585, 194088, 39193, '<td valign="top">I think you have a great eye, and are right for wanting to capture this..(whatever part of the auto it is, lol) but I think it could have been composed better. maybe a slightly different angle or perspective..or a bit closer in to an area so we couldn''t see that the repetitions actually end (it needs to appear endless imo!) ..also a slight contrast and brightness +bump with the curves maybe? :) nice shot though. 8 in my book.</td>', 'I think you have a great eye, and are right for wanting to capture this..(whatever part of the auto it is, lol) but I think it could have been composed better. maybe a slightly different angle or perspective..or a bit closer in to an area so we couldn''t see that the repetitions actually end (it needs to appear endless imo!) ..also a slight contrast and brightness +bump with the curves maybe? :) nice shot though. 8 in my book.', '2005-06-28 14:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
