(1488651, 190725, 37200, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I only wish the front part was in focus and the back blurred.  Maybe a little more DOF as well.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I only wish the front part was in focus and the back blurred.  Maybe a little more DOF as well.', '2005-06-28 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488659, 193137, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I can''t tell what this image is.  It looks like a poppy, but poppies aren''t metal.  Maybe a metal poppy sculpture? Interesting as an abstract but not enough clarity for me to make out what it might be.  With no title for help...</td>', 'Honestly, I can''t tell what this image is.  It looks like a poppy, but poppies aren''t metal.  Maybe a metal poppy sculpture? Interesting as an abstract but not enough clarity for me to make out what it might be.  With no title for help...', '2005-06-28 15:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488661, 193926, 33590, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  your an odd cookie.  :)  You''re showing wood not metal.  lol!</td>', 'Hmmm.  your an odd cookie.  :)  You''re showing wood not metal.  lol!', '2005-06-28 15:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488666, 191279, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is kind of metal overkill.  The tinfoil alone would have been really cool.  Even the spoons alone would be really neat.  But the two fight and leave the image flat.  The focus on the spoons is good but I think a little more contrast might help.  An interesting set-up.</td>', 'This is kind of metal overkill.  The tinfoil alone would have been really cool.  Even the spoons alone would be really neat.  But the two fight and leave the image flat.  The focus on the spoons is good but I think a little more contrast might help.  An interesting set-up.', '2005-06-28 15:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488674, 192710, 33590, '<td valign="top">Very powerful photo.  I wish the cross wasnt so blown out...but its still one of my favs in the challenge. 10</td>', 'Very powerful photo.  I wish the cross wasnt so blown out...but its still one of my favs in the challenge. 10', '2005-06-28 15:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488675, 192984, 34192, '<td valign="top">I see the anchor but it seems to be part of the whole subject (the landscape) rather than a main subject.  Love the clouds just peaking over the mountain.  I think a lower point of view would help this shot a lot.  It would put the anchor more prominently in the image and would lessen the impact of the green hose on the image.</td>', 'I see the anchor but it seems to be part of the whole subject (the landscape) rather than a main subject.  Love the clouds just peaking over the mountain.  I think a lower point of view would help this shot a lot.  It would put the anchor more prominently in the image and would lessen the impact of the green hose on the image.', '2005-06-28 15:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488679, 194059, 34192, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from lack of clarity completely due to its size.  POV interesting, DOV excellent.  I just wish I could see it better.</td>', 'This image suffers from lack of clarity completely due to its size.  POV interesting, DOV excellent.  I just wish I could see it better.', '2005-06-28 15:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488687, 192698, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view - it makes the image as the subject is rather boring (what do you expect with a soda can!)  Think the lighting is great - gives the can top depth.  I like the POV - I think it works for this subject.  I think the noise enhances the image - works with the subject. DOF also works.  7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting point of view - it makes the image as the subject is rather boring (what do you expect with a soda can!)  Think the lighting is great - gives the can top depth.  I like the POV - I think it works for this subject.  I think the noise enhances the image - works with the subject. DOF also works.  7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-28 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488719, 192571, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, but it looks like the water is the main subject.  Like the imag ethough.  Maybe a slightly great DOF would improve it.  POV is excellent.</td>', 'Pretty cool, but it looks like the water is the main subject.  Like the imag ethough.  Maybe a slightly great DOF would improve it.  POV is excellent.', '2005-06-28 15:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488723, 191382, 34192, '<td valign="top">The color cast really detracts from this image.  Using levels would help that I think.  The image itself is in focus and composed in an interesting fashion.</td>', 'The color cast really detracts from this image.  Using levels would help that I think.  The image itself is in focus and composed in an interesting fashion.', '2005-06-28 15:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488728, 190590, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  The focus is soft - thinking it is hand shake from not enough light.  The window makes the background too light (blown highlights).  Maybe a lower point of view would make for a more interesting composition and cut some of the glare from the window.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  The focus is soft - thinking it is hand shake from not enough light.  The window makes the background too light (blown highlights).  Maybe a lower point of view would make for a more interesting composition and cut some of the glare from the window.', '2005-06-28 15:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488733, 190625, 34192, '<td valign="top">The composition is interesting but I really don''t care for the coloration effect.  I don''t think it adds to the image as a whole.  B&amp;W may work.</td>', 'The composition is interesting but I really don''t care for the coloration effect.  I don''t think it adds to the image as a whole.  B&W may work.', '2005-06-28 15:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488746, 192315, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have been greatly enhanced with a blue background.  The white competes with the highlights, making the entire image washed out.</td>', 'I think this image would have been greatly enhanced with a blue background.  The white competes with the highlights, making the entire image washed out.', '2005-06-28 16:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488757, 192809, 37200, '<td valign="top">nice idea, very creative!</td>', 'nice idea, very creative!', '2005-06-28 16:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488761, 194016, 37200, '<td valign="top">great subject.  A little more light on the base would be nice.</td>', 'great subject.  A little more light on the base would be nice.', '2005-06-28 16:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488771, 192400, 34192, '<td valign="top">Title referring to the dragons?  Very interesting image.  I like the POV.  Unfortunately, the lack of light and short DOV rendered the closest dragon a blob.  A way to fix this so the dragon is more easily recognizable is to move further away and zoom in on the two dragons.  If you have a little extra frame you can always crop it.  Focal compression technique would also be useful here - it would move the dragons closer together so to speak, enabling you to have a shorter depth of field.</td>', 'Title referring to the dragons?  Very interesting image.  I like the POV.  Unfortunately, the lack of light and short DOV rendered the closest dragon a blob.  A way to fix this so the dragon is more easily recognizable is to move further away and zoom in on the two dragons.  If you have a little extra frame you can always crop it.  Focal compression technique would also be useful here - it would move the dragons closer together so to speak, enabling you to have a shorter depth of field.', '2005-06-28 16:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488780, 194076, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Like the color tones used.  Wish there was more to the bottom of the image - the nuts appearing out of nowhere don''t give me (or them) a base - it makes the image seem truncated (like standing people without feet).  I don''t mind the noise but others will probably comment on it. Think the lighting is well done.</td>', 'Interesting. Like the color tones used.  Wish there was more to the bottom of the image - the nuts appearing out of nowhere don''t give me (or them) a base - it makes the image seem truncated (like standing people without feet).  I don''t mind the noise but others will probably comment on it. Think the lighting is well done.', '2005-06-28 16:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488789, 194085, 34192, '<td valign="top">High definition - pretty cool macro.  People might mistake it for a manhole cover or something. ;)  I like the composition and the contrast.</td>', 'High definition - pretty cool macro.  People might mistake it for a manhole cover or something. ;)  I like the composition and the contrast.', '2005-06-28 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488795, 193097, 34192, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the white on the left is for.  I like the DOF, POV.  Detail, focus, clarity well done.  Haven''t decided on the crop /composition yet.  Not sure if I would like it better on the right or not as the rope cuts the image in half.</td>', 'Not sure what the white on the left is for.  I like the DOF, POV.  Detail, focus, clarity well done.  Haven''t decided on the crop /composition yet.  Not sure if I would like it better on the right or not as the rope cuts the image in half.', '2005-06-28 16:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488952, 193945, 29269, '<td valign="top">It seems to be leaning, some negative rotation might have helped the feel</td>', 'It seems to be leaning, some negative rotation might have helped the feel', '2005-06-28 17:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488959, 193899, 29269, '<td valign="top">Reflections are distracting. Not sure what you could have done to aviod them though. Nice photo otherwise.</td>', 'Reflections are distracting. Not sure what you could have done to aviod them though. Nice photo otherwise.', '2005-06-28 17:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488962, 194079, 29269, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF would be OK if the remote end of the chan weren''t grouped like this. If it was stretching farther, fine. This way you have a relatively major element out of focus.</td>', 'The shallow DOF would be OK if the remote end of the chan weren''t grouped like this. If it was stretching farther, fine. This way you have a relatively major element out of focus.', '2005-06-28 17:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488964, 192557, 39902, '<td valign="top">I am nearly finished going through the 500+ entries for this contest and this is my favorite by far.  I love the contrast of the metal against the bg and this is one serious looking structure.  Great job!</td>', 'I am nearly finished going through the 500+ entries for this contest and this is my favorite by far.  I love the contrast of the metal against the bg and this is one serious looking structure.  Great job!', '2005-06-28 17:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488965, 194108, 37116, '<td valign="top">Nice Composition!</td>', 'Nice Composition!', '2005-06-28 17:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488967, 193097, 29269, '<td valign="top">Aah, pity. You made a bad canvas resize mistake here. Everyone will comment on that, though. Now, for the remaining 90% of your photo:nice use of sepia, but as this challenge was about metal, I would not agree that sepia enhances the appearance of metal in this photo. The title indicates that it is a bell, hence metal, but without the title I would think of this as some sort of pottery work. 4.</td>', 'Aah, pity. You made a bad canvas resize mistake here. Everyone will comment on that, though. Now, for the remaining 90% of your photo:nice use of sepia, but as this challenge was about metal, I would not agree that sepia enhances the appearance of metal in this photo. The title indicates that it is a bell, hence metal, but without the title I would think of this as some sort of pottery work. 4.', '2005-06-28 17:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488972, 192616, 29269, '<td valign="top">Please make sure you get as close as 640 pixels next time as this does a disservice to your photo. It is way too small to get the detail out of it and to judge it.<br/>I know that most comments will be on this topic, and I would like to point out other details for improvement, but it is just not possible on an image this small.<br/>Sorry.</td>', 'Please make sure you get as close as 640 pixels next time as this does a disservice to your photo. It is way too small to get the detail out of it and to judge it.I know that most comments will be on this topic, and I would like to point out other details for improvement, but it is just not possible on an image this small.Sorry.', '2005-06-28 17:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488973, 193887, 37116, '<td valign="top">Very original, colorful, and just plain nice to look at! Cool!</td>', 'Very original, colorful, and just plain nice to look at! Cool!', '2005-06-28 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
