(1489414, 192719, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, there appears to be sharpening artifacts around the chain.  Good exposure on the sky.</td>', 'Good DOF, there appears to be sharpening artifacts around the chain.  Good exposure on the sky.', '2005-06-28 20:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489415, 192950, 29009, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy for my personal taste, but you''ve made the focal point interesting and so a decent score is in order!</td>', 'A bit grainy for my personal taste, but you''ve made the focal point interesting and so a decent score is in order!', '2005-06-28 20:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489436, 192970, 10432, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Very interesting composition, color and contrast. I like the industrial look. It''s too bad the left and right glass area (3rd way down) isn''t symmetrical but it doesn''t appear that you had much control on that - maybe shifting your position a smidge to the right.   Well done</td>', 'I like this.  Very interesting composition, color and contrast. I like the industrial look. It''s too bad the left and right glass area (3rd way down) isn''t symmetrical but it doesn''t appear that you had much control on that - maybe shifting your position a smidge to the right.   Well done', '2005-06-28 20:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489455, 192808, 10432, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment - I really like the lighting and color.  I''m sure you were going for the reflection but I wish the top of this wasn''t cut off.  Maybe step back a few steps.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment - I really like the lighting and color.  I''m sure you were going for the reflection but I wish the top of this wasn''t cut off.  Maybe step back a few steps.  Bumping up.', '2005-06-28 20:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489459, 194072, 10432, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and colors!  Main subject is sharp.  Feels like it could be tilted slightly.  Bumping up.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-26 12:38:17.</i></td>', 'Good lighting and colors!  Main subject is sharp.  Feels like it could be tilted slightly.  Bumping up.', '2005-06-28 21:00:39.000000', '2005-09-26 13:38:17.000000', 1),
(1489462, 192557, 10432, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  Really nice example of metal - well shot.<br/>Returning for a third look and bumping up.</td>', 'Fabulous.  Really nice example of metal - well shot.Returning for a third look and bumping up.', '2005-06-28 21:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489466, 192933, 10432, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  I like how the sun is shining under the pier.  Nicely shot.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  I like how the sun is shining under the pier.  Nicely shot.  Bumping up.', '2005-06-28 21:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
