(1490087, 194054, 37252, '<td valign="top">reds look over-processed and distract from the steel tracks. Tracks are not very focused either. Correct those two things and the photo would be pretty good.</td>', 'reds look over-processed and distract from the steel tracks. Tracks are not very focused either. Correct those two things and the photo would be pretty good.', '2005-06-29 00:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
