(1490095, 193910, 811, '<td valign="top">You have potential here, but I think the horizontal placement on the grass makes it a bit static-y.   The knife looks rather impotent just lying there; I think a more aggressive/dynamic  "pose" would have served you better, and would have given the knife the respect i think you are trying to convey.  Also, I think a better background (the grass makes it seem "innocent" or "weak" to me somehow) and more dramatic lighting would have given this shot the edge it needed (no pun intended.)</td>', 'You have potential here, but I think the horizontal placement on the grass makes it a bit static-y.   The knife looks rather impotent just lying there; I think a more aggressive/dynamic  "pose" would have served you better, and would have given the knife the respect i think you are trying to convey.  Also, I think a better background (the grass makes it seem "innocent" or "weak" to me somehow) and more dramatic lighting would have given this shot the edge it needed (no pun intended.)', '2005-06-29 00:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
