(1490370, 193174, 37380, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first &gt;5.0 score. You even managed to evoke one more 9 and 10 votes than I did in this challenge - I only got one 10 and three 9''s :)<br/> <br/>The gloves are off for the next challenge though!<br/> <br/>Oh and another thing - this is now the second best photo ever submitted to a challenge using this camera! (see <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/camera.php?CAMERA_ID=1055" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/camera.php?CAMERA_ID=1055</a>)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-29 08:19:59.</i></td>', 'Congrats on your first >5.0 score. You even managed to evoke one more 9 and 10 votes than I did in this challenge - I only got one 10 and three 9''s :) The gloves are off for the next challenge though! Oh and another thing - this is now the second best photo ever submitted to a challenge using this camera! (see //www.dpchallenge.com/camera.php?CAMERA_ID=1055)', '2005-06-29 08:35:57.000000', '2005-06-29 09:19:59.000000', 0),
