(1490373, 191499, 30364, '<td valign="top">Howdy bear.  Didn''t vote on Metal (501 entries was more than I could handle).  This is a very well conceived &amp; executed photograph &amp; I''d have rated it higher.  If DPC ever has a competition for the best image titles, however, you''ll be rated Blue Ribbon.  This is another classic.</td>', 'Howdy bear.  Didn''t vote on Metal (501 entries was more than I could handle).  This is a very well conceived & executed photograph & I''d have rated it higher.  If DPC ever has a competition for the best image titles, however, you''ll be rated Blue Ribbon.  This is another classic.', '2005-06-29 08:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1490378, 191135, 37719, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments!  I do appreciate them.  In response to one - pure zinc is not shiney until you melt, cut, or break it.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments!  I do appreciate them.  In response to one - pure zinc is not shiney until you melt, cut, or break it.', '2005-06-29 08:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1490385, 193975, 24951, '<td valign="top">WOW - I couldn''t believe it when I woke up this morning and looking through the photos I was 12th! My BEST yet!!! Thanks everyone.<br/> <br/>It''s the front wheel of my husband''s Honda Valkrie - a very large touring bike. I had accidently flipped it to an indoor lighting mode but some of the better shots were unusable due to basic editing restraints.Again thanks everyone.</td>', 'WOW - I couldn''t believe it when I woke up this morning and looking through the photos I was 12th! My BEST yet!!! Thanks everyone. It''s the front wheel of my husband''s Honda Valkrie - a very large touring bike. I had accidently flipped it to an indoor lighting mode but some of the better shots were unusable due to basic editing restraints.Again thanks everyone.', '2005-06-29 08:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1490386, 194059, 38648, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the tips on the mechanics of getting the image larger.  I had difficulty in getting the image to load properly in my first challenge.</td>', 'Thanks for the tips on the mechanics of getting the image larger.  I had difficulty in getting the image to load properly in my first challenge.', '2005-06-29 08:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1490402, 192571, 39336, '<td valign="top">This was my first challange and I didn''t realize how picky people were going to be. It is metal. Which is what the challenge was calling for. I didn''t at the time think that I was showing too much water, now I do. Thanks for looking and thanks for the comments.</td>', 'This was my first challange and I didn''t realize how picky people were going to be. It is metal. Which is what the challenge was calling for. I didn''t at the time think that I was showing too much water, now I do. Thanks for looking and thanks for the comments.', '2005-06-29 08:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
