(1490428, 192342, 30364, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Chris.  Didn''t vote (couldn''t face 501 entries, I''m afraid).  However, this ribbon is about as overdue as it''s possible to be.  Your stuff is consistently some of the best and most thoughtful on the DPC site.  In particular, your compositional skills are exemplary.  I encourage everyone who looks at this ribbon winner to also check out the rest of your work on your profile page.</td>', 'Congratulations, Chris.  Didn''t vote (couldn''t face 501 entries, I''m afraid).  However, this ribbon is about as overdue as it''s possible to be.  Your stuff is consistently some of the best and most thoughtful on the DPC site.  In particular, your compositional skills are exemplary.  I encourage everyone who looks at this ribbon winner to also check out the rest of your work on your profile page.', '2005-06-29 08:58:23.000000', NULL, 0),
