(1490495, 193137, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments... I wanted to make a point about pictures without title, the point is: peolple need help to see things.<br/> <br/>With a title like "metallic petal" this picture would have got a decent score (maybe 5.1 :), what do You think?<br/> <br/>The reflection is so "good" that metal disappears :), so maybe the title could have been: "invisible metal" :)<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments... I wanted to make a point about pictures without title, the point is: peolple need help to see things. With a title like "metallic petal" this picture would have got a decent score (maybe 5.1 :), what do You think? The reflection is so "good" that metal disappears :), so maybe the title could have been: "invisible metal" :) Thanks again!', '2005-06-29 09:16:52.000000', NULL, 0),
