(1490565, 192342, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon!  And it''s a beautiful shot too.  Such lovely tones.  It''s also a milestone to win this without the additional sharpening!  I think too many photos here are "oversharpened"; there''s a beauty in a subtle softness too--and I think it works well here with the hardness of the metal.  Good luck for many future ribbons.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon!  And it''s a beautiful shot too.  Such lovely tones.  It''s also a milestone to win this without the additional sharpening!  I think too many photos here are "oversharpened"; there''s a beauty in a subtle softness too--and I think it works well here with the hardness of the metal.  Good luck for many future ribbons.', '2005-06-29 09:43:44.000000', NULL, 0),
