(1491085, 192342, 27763, '<td valign="top">It feels good to have won a ribbon!  Thanks everybody for your votes and comments!  I will have to post a pic of the setup that I used for this shot.  Probably later tonight.</td>', 'It feels good to have won a ribbon!  Thanks everybody for your votes and comments!  I will have to post a pic of the setup that I used for this shot.  Probably later tonight.', '2005-06-29 11:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
