(1492652, 192870, 16230, '<td valign="top">What a great image! Congratulations on another blue ribbon. Only the best for you, eh?<br/> <br/>I''m wondering how you managed to get this view. It looks like it was shot from land (somewhere off the bridge) using a long telephoto lens, but the photo info says you used an 18-55mm zoom. Is this a crop from a larger photo?<br/></td>', 'What a great image! Congratulations on another blue ribbon. Only the best for you, eh? I''m wondering how you managed to get this view. It looks like it was shot from land (somewhere off the bridge) using a long telephoto lens, but the photo info says you used an 18-55mm zoom. Is this a crop from a larger photo?', '2005-06-29 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
