(1492675, 192870, 5286, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by micknewton:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>I''m wondering how you managed to get this view. It looks like it was shot from land (somewhere off the bridge) using a long telephoto lens, but the photo info says you used an 18-55mm zoom. Is this a crop from a larger photo? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This was actually taken from on the bridge... walking along the bridge towards Presidio, there''s a lookout point at the base of the towers. This was shot from there, leaning outwards from the bridge. I actually would have liked more of an angle, but that would need me to be suspended over the water somehow :)...</td>', 'Originally posted by micknewton: I''m wondering how you managed to get this view. It looks like it was shot from land (somewhere off the bridge) using a long telephoto lens, but the photo info says you used an 18-55mm zoom. Is this a crop from a larger photo?   This was actually taken from on the bridge... walking along the bridge towards Presidio, there''s a lookout point at the base of the towers. This was shot from there, leaning outwards from the bridge. I actually would have liked more of an angle, but that would need me to be suspended over the water somehow :)...', '2005-06-29 18:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
