(1493331, 193954, 22379, '<td valign="top">mmmmm sugar coated almonds! I gave you an 8 beckettboots. Like you i found the contrast of the shiny metal and the pastel almonds quite appealing. Having seen the original image, i would have cropped it a bit differently. A few pixels more to the left and at the bottom so the image isnt so tight to the shiny silver and i probably would have left just a bit more almons in the image.<br/>The photo is much more interesting at an off squewed angle, and you should pride yourself on having the confidence to look at a fairly everyday item from a origial perspective. <br/> If advanced editting were allowed, i would spot edit the little target reflections on the blue and pink almonds.Really not much else to say, as this is a very well exicuted photo.</td>', 'mmmmm sugar coated almonds! I gave you an 8 beckettboots. Like you i found the contrast of the shiny metal and the pastel almonds quite appealing. Having seen the original image, i would have cropped it a bit differently. A few pixels more to the left and at the bottom so the image isnt so tight to the shiny silver and i probably would have left just a bit more almons in the image.The photo is much more interesting at an off squewed angle, and you should pride yourself on having the confidence to look at a fairly everyday item from a origial perspective.  If advanced editting were allowed, i would spot edit the little target reflections on the blue and pink almonds.Really not much else to say, as this is a very well exicuted photo.', '2005-06-29 22:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
