(1493941, 194058, 19780, '<td valign="top">I thought this was an exceptionally inventive image. Technically good, with a strong depth of field, good focus and a great subject.<br/> <br/>I need to check it on another monitor, but there''s a slight green tinge to it for me, that seems to give it less of a metallic look to me. The depth of field and motion blur really makes this photo pop. <br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on the whole challenge (on vacation) but I would have given you a 7.</td>', 'I thought this was an exceptionally inventive image. Technically good, with a strong depth of field, good focus and a great subject. I need to check it on another monitor, but there''s a slight green tinge to it for me, that seems to give it less of a metallic look to me. The depth of field and motion blur really makes this photo pop.  I didn''t vote on the whole challenge (on vacation) but I would have given you a 7.', '2005-06-30 01:26:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1494035, 190922, 35786, '<td valign="top">I am truly disappointed- gave it an 8 and thought it would rank much higher. just wanted to let you know that I thought it was creative and well shot.</td>', 'I am truly disappointed- gave it an 8 and thought it would rank much higher. just wanted to let you know that I thought it was creative and well shot.', '2005-06-30 02:02:34.000000', NULL, 0),
