(1500464, 192321, 23394, '<td valign="top">creative take on the challenge, and a nice perspective to shoot from.  it looks like you got a lot of good comments with some technical suggestions--hope you find them useful.  you might want to check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a> to get a really good idea about improving you scores.  good luck, keep on shooting!</td>', 'creative take on the challenge, and a nice perspective to shoot from.  it looks like you got a lot of good comments with some technical suggestions--hope you find them useful.  you might want to check out this thread to get a really good idea about improving you scores.  good luck, keep on shooting!', '2005-07-02 19:45:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1500473, 192357, 38941, '<td valign="top">I dont like this at all, i think any tourist can make this photo.<br/>A creative choice of subject, good composition, contrast and color, maybe some extra techniques like depth of field or panning etc are some things needed to make a challenge entry very interesting. Your image has none.<br/>You just saw metal as the theme for the challenge and made a shot of some metal on the street. Sorry, no creativity points there.<br/>Even the name could have been something related to time and the world since u have a clock there. The name is not the description.<br/>Hope my comment was useful to motivate you. Keep trying</td>', 'I dont like this at all, i think any tourist can make this photo.A creative choice of subject, good composition, contrast and color, maybe some extra techniques like depth of field or panning etc are some things needed to make a challenge entry very interesting. Your image has none.You just saw metal as the theme for the challenge and made a shot of some metal on the street. Sorry, no creativity points there.Even the name could have been something related to time and the world since u have a clock there. The name is not the description.Hope my comment was useful to motivate you. Keep trying', '2005-07-02 19:56:41.000000', NULL, 0),
