(1508185, 191142, 36078, '<td valign="top">From the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I think the subject totally meets the challenge.  But I think it suites a more narrow type of viewer ie fishing people. <br/> <br/>Nice tight closeup of the subject.  Their is metal but because it is covered by the fuzz/feathers it is rather more implied.  <br/> <br/>Nothing at all wrong with the shot photographically ie lighting,focus ect ect.  Maybe a change in the backdrop/background would make the subject pop out more.<br/> <br/>Very unique photo on a dying art.</td>', 'From the Critique Club I think the subject totally meets the challenge.  But I think it suites a more narrow type of viewer ie fishing people.  Nice tight closeup of the subject.  Their is metal but because it is covered by the fuzz/feathers it is rather more implied.   Nothing at all wrong with the shot photographically ie lighting,focus ect ect.  Maybe a change in the backdrop/background would make the subject pop out more. Very unique photo on a dying art.', '2005-07-05 15:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
