(1657111, 191379, 17507, '<td valign="top">I just discovered this image, which I never saw during the voting--I''m really surprised its final score was below 6. Deserved a better placement.</td>', 'I just discovered this image, which I never saw during the voting--I''m really surprised its final score was below 6. Deserved a better placement.', '2005-08-30 04:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1659650, 190968, 2780, '<td valign="top">The b&amp;w processing here is good, as the highlights aren''t blown out at all and there is a good range of shades. The only problem is the slight out of focus-ness. Bringing the camera back slightly, letting it focus, and then cropping a little more in post processing would probably help you get a sharper result :)</td>', 'The b&w processing here is good, as the highlights aren''t blown out at all and there is a good range of shades. The only problem is the slight out of focus-ness. Bringing the camera back slightly, letting it focus, and then cropping a little more in post processing would probably help you get a sharper result :)', '2005-08-30 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1665086, 192970, 36429, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the orange. Almost looks like a Moroccan doorway, the shape of the hole in the frame of the photo.</td>', 'I love the composition and the orange. Almost looks like a Moroccan doorway, the shape of the hole in the frame of the photo.', '2005-09-01 04:47:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1669767, 191419, 42100, '<td valign="top">Top notch! Love the contrast.  Keep up the good work,</td>', 'Top notch! Love the contrast.  Keep up the good work,', '2005-09-02 19:24:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1682088, 191422, 10909, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Caltrop:</b></div><hr/><i> well... I was a carpenter for many years and even though i recognize the difficulty in handcrafting something this shot to me is unappealing. The light is a little harsh and the shadow on the hand make the hand ehhh I am not sure how to put this but.... i guess too dark.?   Finally the theme was metal and the image is primarily composed of wood and flesh with the metal dull and unpronounced. Oh yeah one more thing the chisel you are using seems a wee bit on the large size to be carving a man shape.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps a wee bit- sorry if that was harsh. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Your critique is fair, it wasn''t harsh :) About size of chisel... I guess I just wasn''t honest enough in this shot - I used this chisel in other places and here I just handles it to show more metal :) And.. I was punished for this lie :) It really looks some weird... :(<br/> <br/>But I will show you the final result - hope, it looks more promising, than on this shot (it''s my first wood work).<br/> <br/>Thanks for opinion.</td>', 'Originally posted by Caltrop: well... I was a carpenter for many years and even though i recognize the difficulty in handcrafting something this shot to me is unappealing. The light is a little harsh and the shadow on the hand make the hand ehhh I am not sure how to put this but.... i guess too dark.?   Finally the theme was metal and the image is primarily composed of wood and flesh with the metal dull and unpronounced. Oh yeah one more thing the chisel you are using seems a wee bit on the large size to be carving a man shape. I hope this helps a wee bit- sorry if that was harsh.   Your critique is fair, it wasn''t harsh :) About size of chisel... I guess I just wasn''t honest enough in this shot - I used this chisel in other places and here I just handles it to show more metal :) And.. I was punished for this lie :) It really looks some weird... :( But I will show you the final result - hope, it looks more promising, than on this shot (it''s my first wood work). Thanks for opinion.', '2005-09-07 10:03:21.000000', NULL, 0),
